OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue fears 'on par with foot
OL,4,Aand mouth'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer who is vaccinating his sheep
OL,7,Fagainst bluetongue has said fears of
OL,8,Fthe outbreak are "on a par with foot
OL,9,Fand mouth."
OL,11,FSeven cases of bluetongue have been
OL,12,Fconfirmed so far in Shropshire, meaning
OL,13,Fit has been identified on seven farms.
OL,15,FGraham Price, who runs a beef and sheep
OL,16,Ffarm near Ludlow, said he was "very
OL,17,Frelieved" to have been vaccinating his
OL,18,Fflock.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
